Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼我來說明測驗規則
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,勝者的條件是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,討伐深度8的惡魔, 魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你們知道魔眼狒狒王嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是個會讀取人心的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,外觀幾乎是隻猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,額頭上的第三隻眼睛可以讀取人心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,性格狡猾又殘忍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,過去討伐失敗的探索者們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在死之前都受到慘烈的拷問
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你的解說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼騎士團和蒼之天外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你們要在這場討伐中互相競爭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,先擊敗魔眼狒狒王的隊伍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,將會是這場測驗的贏家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在討伐魔眼狒狒王之前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也可以討伐敵隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我們隊伍主張不殺人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而且從來不曾違背這一點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他的問題攸關我們隊伍的核心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:00:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,請放心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.19,0:01:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我們接受妨礙對手的行為
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但禁止殺人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在對手倒下時
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就不可繼續追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,限制行動也要選在沒有惡魔的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,以上就是這次測驗的規則
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,測驗時, 各位將受到我的技能監視
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不會有作弊的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就沒問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有關測驗開始前的妨礙呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望規則可以訂得明確一點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我前幾天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,差點被他們隊上的妖精暴力相向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得自己有點危險
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定會被暗算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,諾艾爾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你能原諒我們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為我信得過你這番話?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要的很簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不只要禁止測驗前的任何妨礙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要求測驗當天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:02:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,兩隊人馬都要以最佳狀態到齊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,既然有這層理由
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意附帶這些條件
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,最後一項
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這次的測驗是破例進行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不會再有第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我希望你們也展現出各自的覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,落敗的人請解散隊伍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且今後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不許與相同的成員繼續組隊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要是違反規定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,將被沒收探索者資格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你們都同意這些條件
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,請在這裡簽名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,雙方在此達成協議
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.26,0:02:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,測驗訂在三天後的正午
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,諾艾爾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這話聽起來可能很傲慢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但論實力的話是我們比較強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:03:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不過你好像擁有顛覆常識的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我們絕對不會掉以輕心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,會盡全力挑戰這場測驗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我就告訴你一件好事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我在前陣子提升階級
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,已經得到新的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"戰術家"的特性是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,擁有近乎預知未來的演算能力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得見喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,輸掉的你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在我面前狼狽地嚎啕大哭的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我很期待跟你們交手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,蒼之天外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,肉眼看不見 高掛心頭的信念
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,將化為武器 貫穿無法應付的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有什麼不想輸的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一切唯有變強
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,開始轉動的Story
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a choice to make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,迷惘早已捨棄在後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,只求超越深淵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm falling into the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一定會抵達 悲傷的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,無人知曉的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,將一切都化為力量 掌握在手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The tactics to win
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼騎士團以及蒼之天外的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很高興能平安迎來這一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,現在開始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,雙方隊伍即將探索深淵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,並討伐此深淵的核心, 魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,測驗開始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,諾艾爾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你們到底在做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟你看到的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在吃午餐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,這可是一場爭奪戰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,應該沒有時間悠哉吃飯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,餓著肚子不能打仗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道有句話叫欲速則不達嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我們讓實力較強的前輩先攻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你們先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,胡鬧也該有個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁, 不要理他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在我們被迫與實力差的人競爭的當下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,給主考官的印象就不是很好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,沒時間慢慢來的人是我們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,諾艾爾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我對你很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,先鋒要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大約五分鐘後
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我們在這邊迎擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人準備戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前, 我能說句話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,或許我不該在這種狀況下提出這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想在還有餘力時先談談
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,前幾天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,諾艾爾．修特廉有來找我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他說了一些難聽的狂妄言論
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,還要求我背叛天翼騎士團
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我當然拒絕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但那個傢伙說不定…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也對其他人做了同樣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他也有來找我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我當然也拒絕了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我不可能背叛大家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,其實他也有來找我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以諾艾爾他…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想拉攏我以外的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,太荒謬了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不可能背叛伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,說到底
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼叫做"叛徒的好處是獲得自由"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,簡直莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,荒謬到連笑話都算不上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他的目的就是要讓我們疑神疑鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,削弱我們的戰力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他的手段真的是很骯髒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,能現在說清楚, 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是天翼騎士團
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不對, 雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不會背叛你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,敵人的先鋒加速了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要一鼓作氣來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"聖盾屏障"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我先稱讚你真有一套吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,偽造信件實在太過火了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,贊成我這個計畫的人是你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但我並不是同意你冒充協會之名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那你要取消我的資格嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你這個人…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不討喜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝稱讚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,會贏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,會贏喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我從不滅惡鬼身上學到的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這種戰鬥方式
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,當我們在這裡悠悠哉哉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被天翼騎士團搶先一步…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我說過了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是策略的一環
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他們很強
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,正因為這樣, 我們才必須等待
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼騎士團
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁在團隊中也是個極其優秀的隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他不只戰鬥能力高強
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也很擅長掌握戰況
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他還有一個被稱為"天翼"的異能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,魔力流動的速度天生就比別人快
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,技能發動的速度就跟思考一樣迅速
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真是上天賜予的特別才能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,出類拔萃有時也會變成枷鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其以他的個性更是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因為他堅持確實的勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,還有正確的選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那有什麼不好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他們應該很快就會證明給我們看了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,贏的會是我們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,種子已經撒下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經告訴雷翁以外的三個人…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來確切會發生的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼騎士團會分崩離析
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,因為雷翁會背叛他們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,(11. 正確的代價)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.19,0:10:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你嚇我也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你還記得爭奪戰的規則吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是說自己不是來搞妨礙行為的?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,規則是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,當天雙方伙伴需以最佳狀態到齊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,又不禁止賽前友善接觸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你可不能動用暴力將我趕走喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你該不會是為此才增加那條規則吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,凱姆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛天翼騎士團吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:11:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想笑死我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那背叛有什麼好處?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,金錢? 地位?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,還是女人?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是自由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我會給你自由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,自由?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,跟著一個特別的人很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁身為探索者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,確實有天賦之才
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.09,0:11:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且還不是普通的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你身為兒時玩伴, 應該是最了解的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼騎士團太扭曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,即使就這樣成為戰團
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不久之後, 你們將會跟不上雷翁的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.77,0:11:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼努力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,依舊比不上與生俱來的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,未來只有對自己的絕望在等著你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凱姆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,放自己自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,現在就是一個好機會
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,確實如你所說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我們很扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,即使如此我還是想支持那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是身為大哥的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的甘願這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我的願望才不是什麼自由
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那先背叛的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是雷翁了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凱姆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伏拉卡夫就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,奧菲莉亞, 你來支援
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有好多玩具可以玩可以粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,和魔眼狒狒王開始戰鬥後
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,已經過了一個小時
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然眷屬已經除掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,戰況卻很明顯對我們不利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,炎精招來(Phlogiston)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,被看穿了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.85,0:12:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,讀取人心的魔猿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,偷襲也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是只要有我的天翼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"神聖波動"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大家, 快點躲開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,諾艾爾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我們再不行動沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要著急
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等他們用盡全力, 看清自己的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前都待命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,奧菲莉亞!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具, 破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一點一點破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,全員撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我負責殿後
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"聖盾屏障"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"鋼之意志"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具好強
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但其實強的只有你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,恐懼和不安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真是低級的挑釁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,終究是隻猴子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,逞強也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心說著我們贏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,現在贏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是探索者絕對不會放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就算輸了一次, 也一定會獲勝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"絕對防禦"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,動得了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,手已經有知覺了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但可能沒辦法拉弓
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁, 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:14:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我們又還沒輸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,各位…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一個計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我來當誘餌引誘它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,等它上鉤的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你就使出"騎士"最強技能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"日輪極光"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,太危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是因為發出一擊就會耗掉你全部的魔力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,問題是攻擊範圍太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,會波及到你們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要我這個誘餌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,伏拉卡夫設下的這個結界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,會隔絕我們與惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可是一旦發動強悍的攻擊技能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,結界就會被攻擊餘波毀壞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我們沒辦法從這裡突襲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就算這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁, 快回想起那個時候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我們聲名大噪的森林邪龍之戰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我來當誘餌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,盡可能將它引到遠處
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不是要自殺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我會跟那個時候一樣, 成功逃給你看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,現在的狀況和當時不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,魔眼狒狒王會讀取人心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它很快就會看穿你是誘餌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那你說該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要是撤退, 我們就會失去資格
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼騎士團會解散
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也會分崩離析
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有一個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一個計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我們和蒼之天外會合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只要和他們合作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就能討伐魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不用犧牲任何人也能戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣子測驗會變成什麼樣子?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,放棄測驗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只要跟他們一同戰鬥, 完成這個任務
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就算協會拒絕我們創立戰團
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,應該也能避免隊伍遭到解散
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,先背叛的人就是雷翁了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.77,0:17:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然跟那傢伙說的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙說的話是這個意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你們是什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是認真的嗎, 雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,蒼之天外…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他們可是敵人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是我們應該打敗的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,否則我們還能怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不犧牲任何一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,以隊長的身分守護大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這是最正確的選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你總是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,正不正確在這種情況下根本…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,凱姆, 你冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.01,0:17:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,這不像你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很冷靜\N這不像你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我很冷靜地思考我們的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不相信我, 而是相信敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你更相信諾艾爾．修特廉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你相比
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我更相信諾艾爾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是你的回答嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,叛徒…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我避開了要害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,凱姆…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很嫉妒你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你擁有我沒有的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是我的小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.53,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我以為你信任我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才能堅持到現在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是為了你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就算會失去生命…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我已經不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我撐不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,想獲得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼騎士團的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦你們當開路先鋒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具玩具…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,新的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面, 魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是諾艾爾．修特廉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,諾艾爾…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會成為你的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,來互相殘殺吧, 潑猴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,昊牙, 動手!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你們為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就照著訓練來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"明鏡止水"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.61,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,攻擊和思考同時到來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.82,0:20:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,與思考同步發動技能的異能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,能使用天翼的只有雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我們利用"思考共有"來訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.25,0:20:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,學會了接近天翼狀態的全神貫注攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,靈髓彈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是一發一千萬菲爾的魔法子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你…為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明明有在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,卻讀不到你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"戰術家"的超高速思考
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,遠遠超過魔眼狒狒王能讀取的範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,思考太快, 導致無法判讀情報
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看來變成玩具的人是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,殺了你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,殺了你!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.51,0:21:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,昊牙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.25,0:21:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"櫻花狂咲"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,思考太多, 腦袋快爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我把高速思考轉換成高速分割思考
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,對於能讀取人心的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.81,0:21:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,想必非常吵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不能原諒你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不原諒你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這…這樣我的腦袋就不會痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.21,0:21:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,指令
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,亞兒瑪, 刺死他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:21:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"速度提升"十二倍速
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you understand my word
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear my voice telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you join to fight with me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.22,0:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I see all crystal clear
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.23,0:22:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Among all tangled strings
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.81,0:22:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to treat it as cold as
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Threads with cold blood
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.57,0:22:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of taking sugarcoated
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pills to make you eased
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I directly talk inside your head
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To make you strong
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.71,0:23:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause i see it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We can break
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The old empire
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With our powers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.14,0:23:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it over
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In near future
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,with no fear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(12. 那條蛇長出了翅膀)
